### 1. Test Server Health
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### 3. Create a New Product (PDF Step 1)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Steel Rods",
  "sku": "STL-001",
  "category": "Raw Material",
  "uom": "kg",
  "initialStock": 0
}

### 4. Receive Stock (Receipt Flow: +100 kg)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productSku": "STL-001",
  "quantity": 100,
  "supplier": "Tata Steel"
}

### 5. Internal Transfer (Main Store -> Production Rack: 20 kg)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productSku": "STL-001",
  "fromLocation": "Main Store",
  "toLocation": "Production Rack",
  "quantity": 20
}

### 6. Deliver Stock (Delivery Flow: -20 kg)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productSku": "STL-001",
  "quantity": 20,
  "customer": "ABC Constructions"
}

### 7. Stock Adjustment (Damaged: -3 kg)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/adjustments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productSku": "STL-001",
  "physicalCount": 77,
  "reason": "3 kg damaged"
}

### 8. View Move History / Stock Ledger
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ledger